{"version":1,"content":"\n<p>Lumora 將手機相簿化身為可上下滑動的私人動態牆，把相片整理成貼文，並在瀏覽時協助清理重複、模糊相片與大型影片。適合想重溫舊片段、整理相片庫及釋放儲存空間的 iPhone、iPad 用戶；原價 US $0.99，現正<a href=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/category/apps-%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/%E9%99%90%E6%99%82%E5%85%8D%E8%B2%BB%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">限時免費</a>。</p>\n<figure><img alt=\"限時免費\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"460\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/460x460Icon-Ap-SiOS01-75-63.webp\" width=\"460\"/></figure>\n<h2>垂直滑動重溫相片</h2>\n<p>開啟後可上下滑動重溫相片與影片，長按加速、雙擊讚好；同時段相片會自動組成貼文，並以兩欄網格瀏覽。整理模式可左滑刪除、右滑保留，找出重複、模糊、連拍、截圖與大型影片，壓縮影片並同步系統相簿。另可按日期、內容或留言搜尋，所有處理均在本機完成，支援離線與 Face ID 鎖定。</p>\n<figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1290x2796bb-24-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1181\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1290x2796bb-25-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1181\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1290x2796bb-26-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1181\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1290x2796bb-27-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1181\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1290x2796bb-28-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1181\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1290x2796bb-29-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1181\"/></figure></figure>\n<ul><li>應用名稱：Lumora: Photo Cleaner &amp; Feed</li><li>應用類別：Photo &amp; Video</li><li>下載位置：<a href=\"https://apps.apple.com/app/lumora-photo-cleaner-feed/id6825000420?uo=4\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">App Store</a></li></ul>\n","scraped_at":"2026-11-04T08:05:37.467699+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":332,"images":7,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-04T07:41:29+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-04T14:58:52.988701+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-04T07:58:45.012951+00:00","content_hash":"a94ee7ea3b5ed413967055ff1499bffd398b33689f969692f0b6c1ee8ad11626","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}